      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对我而言，这不过是幕间剧中必经的阶段。\n不过观众们希望我拿下“皋月赏”的胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebcd2da5edef96271fa1798dede3eb95ecbb46ec05127cab40ef63f376549f74",
